cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite it as below."
title: "AlphaLuck: Trading versus Holding in a Live Language-Model Competition"
abstract: >-
  Reconstruction of the 38 accounts of the Alpha Arena language-model trading
  competition from public Hyperliquid records, with the raw on-chain data, the
  derived data and the code that reproduces every number, table and figure of
  the letter, plus six standalone Quantlets that reproduce selected results
  from minimal derived inputs. Organiser payloads and licensed prices are not
  redistributed.
type: software
